summary: Configuration test of tang operator
description: |
    Verify that the tang operator correctly handles minimal (single replica),
    main (three replicas), and multiple deployment (five pods, two services)
    configurations by checking that the expected number of pods and services
    start and stop properly.
contact: Patrik Koncity <pkoncity@redhat.com>
component:
  - tang
test: ./runtest.sh
recommend:
  - tang
duration: 15m
enabled: true
tag:
  - NoRHEL6
  - NoRHEL7
  - NoRHEL8
  - Tier3
tier: '3'
adjust:
  - enabled: false
    when: distro < rhel-9
    continue: false
  - enabled: false
    when: distro == rhel-alt-7
    continue: false
id: f369603b-3dc5-430d-9fd8-cfbcfbcb766f
